diagram sequence
title Checkout sequence
user[User]{icon: logos:chrome} -> api[Order API] : POST /checkout
api -> redis[Redis]{shape: db} : check stock
branch in stock
  redis --> api : OK
  api -> pg[Payment Provider] : authorize
  branch approved
    pg --> api : approved
    api -> kafka[Kafka]{shape: queue} : order.paid
    api --> user : 201
  else declined
    pg -x api : declined
    api --> user : 402
  end
else sold out
  redis -x api : sold out
  api --> user : 409
end
